        "id": 1809421
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-03T00:06:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What is this? A wrapped key? A handle? A key + metadata? I\u0027m guessing the ambiguity is intentional, but it should be documented as being implementation defined along with the set of properties that can be expected. `set_key_validity()` seems to imply this carries metadata, but is that actually the case? Is this key blob expected to be usable across reboots? Across sessions?",
      "revId": "596f627b3a10f7c853acfb165da1a6ccdd0c089b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
