      },
      "lineNbr": 18,
      "author": {
        "id": 1942645
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-06-05T19:35:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Added more details to its docstring. Let me know if this is OK, or if you think more needs to be added. Currently what I have in mind will not be valid across reboots (that is also a requirement, if not the `set_key_validity` do not makes sense) and it should also work across sessions, but because I am not sure if the across sessions use is needed, I am not committing to it yet.",
      "parentUuid": "4e196622_438697f2",
      "revId": "596f627b3a10f7c853acfb165da1a6ccdd0c089b",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
